{
  "about": "veffgranular: a granular sample synth engine in the unit's engine list (shift and T1 on a synth sound). Grains of one sample, pitched from the note: classic, loop and cloud modes. Knobs: position, size, density, spray; with shift: scan, spread, tune, volume. Presses: mode, window, loop length, file; with shift a press resets its value. The sample: a WAV or AIFF named 1..8 in the folder veffgranular (4 MiB of working memory), or, switched on by a file sampler.on there, the synth sampler's own sample of the sound's slot (OS 1.7.3+0, not confirmed on a unit). Veff page. Changes no place of the firmware; needs the base.",
